              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kidieli kikagata ni kidieli chi ihiiri ya Gadi kolovega lwi Isavaalu, ulwako lulatula mu lidaala lia Tamara kuduuka ku mazi ga Meribazi Kadeshi. Lulavitira kolovega lwi Imadioli wu mugera gwa Egebeti kuduuka ku inyanza ya Meditareniani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.28",
