          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lidaala lia Jerusalemi lilava ni virivwa kuli ndi: Kolovega lwa Ivaale lidigi lilava uvutambi zimita 2,250. Kolovega lwene yilu lulava ni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "virivwa 3; Kirivwa cha Rubeni, kirivwa cha Yuda, kandi kirivwa cha Levi. Virivwa yivi vilagulikwa mita gi zihiiri zia Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolovega lwi Ivugwi lidigi lilava uvutambi zimita 2,250. Lovega yilu lulava ni virivwa 3: kirivwa cha Josefu, kirivwa cha Benjamini kandi kirivwa cha Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolovega lwi Isavaalu lulava ni lidigi zimita 2,250 uvutambi. Lovega yilu lulava ni virivwa 3: Kirivwa cha Simioni, kirivwa cha Isakari kandi kirivwa cha Zabuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolovega lwi Imadioli, lidigi lilava zimita 2,250 uvutambi. Lovega yilu lulava ni virivwa 3: Kirivwa cha Gadi, kirivwa cha Asheri kandi kirivwa cha Nafutali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvutambi vwosi vwi lidigi lie lidaala zimbega ziosi zine ni zimita 9,000. Lieta lie Lidaala yili kutura kalunu lilalangwa, “Yahova Aveeye Hano!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.35"
            ]
          }
        }
